<QuestionLayout
  title="What is the difference between an AI agent and the Traverse runtime?"
  description="Agents propose plans and arguments. The Traverse runtime validates contracts, executes sandboxed WASM capabilities, and records traces. One suggests; the other decides what actually runs."
